; Consumer spec referencing the dependency's @duplicates-preserve table rules (`preserve_map`,
; `preserve_nmap`). Generated via --extern-import at the dep's minted export; the rebuilt types must
; be the pair-map twins (preserve on both sides of the crate boundary), not reject-default BTreeMaps.
